<title>JAPAN: Fuji Electric Ind - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Electric Ind - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.96		vs	    1.73</p>
<p> Operating	  537    million    vs	  410    million</p>
<p> Current	    544    million    vs	  410    million</p>
<p> Net		  293    million    vs	  213    million</p>
<p> EPS		   44.03 yen	  vs	   32.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Electric Industry Co Ltd is a manufacturer of control switches.</p>
